Cell["\<\
The weekly pattern starts on Sunday at 5am and finishes the next Sunday at 4am.
The hourly dataset starts on a Thursday at 12am.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.932027363856069*^9, 3.9320274191698*^9}, {
