Cell["\<\
There is still some residual periodicity in autocorrelation factor but it \
quickly decreases to random noise.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.931343649042539*^9, 3.9313436541749*^9}, {
  3.931343714377239*^9, 3.931343727044786*^9}, {3.9321105098250656`*^9, 
